  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nHi there devs!\nFirst of all, thanks for the great work! I have been a happy Homarr user since a little over a year and only just saw there was a new version. After upgrading and importing my settings I saw the sidebars were missing, found out they were removed in the new update. Will they be added in a future update again? I really miss them as they are very useful to me. Hope to see them again in the future. Keep up the good work!\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
