      "updated_at": "2026-08-15T10:03:11Z",
      "body": "Hello everyone following this issue, as announced yesterday on discord, sidebars will be part of homarr's v2, if you'd like to try them out they are available on the demo image / the v2 demo. They are enabled via the board settings. They can be between 1-3 columns wide. \n\nI recommend using a temporary docker container so that you can stop the process when you're done testing ;)\n\nDemo website : https://app-v2.preview.homarr.dev/\n\n```\ndocker run -d --rm --name homarr-v2 -p 7575:7575 -v homarr-v2:/appdata \\\n  -e SECRET_ENCRYPTION_KEY=\"c2d5f85f7d3968d20fcea2a5df26d0f8545cd75bac3a31976a5dce4238f5ad80\" \\\n  -e WORKSHOP_API_URL=\"https://v2.preview.homarr.dev\" \\\n  ghcr.io/homarr-labs/homarr-test:v2\n```\n\nOptionally, add -e DEMO_MODE=\"true\" if you'd like to skip onboarding\n\n\nAny feedback regarding the sidebars would be much appreciated. \n\n\n\n## Preview\n<img width=\"800\" height=\"469\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8393c849-97ce-417d-b761-13a1ce08b69d\" />\n",
